01:01:10.370 --> 01:01:19.190
<v Ira Glass>You know, I was short on money for lunch the other day. And I said, Torey, you have any cash? Do you have cash? He got really defensive.
<v Ira Glass>你知道，我前几天午饭钱不够。我问，托雷，你有现金吗？你有现金吗？他表现得非常有戒心。

01:01:19.190 --> 01:01:23.670
<v Will>I never had a rash. There's no rash. I don't know what they're talking about.
<v Will>我从来没长过皮疹。根本没有皮疹。我不知道他们在说什么。

01:01:23.670 --> 01:01:28.670
